#: svelte/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Vite + Svelte app styled with [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components)\n"
"and [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) "
"(icon action + token reads).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `register()` (from `@pantoken/svelte`) once at "
"bootstrap so elements like\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token CSS plus "
"`@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `src/App.svelte`'s markup is styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Ap Vite + Svelte wedi'i steilio gyda [`@pantoken/components`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) a [`@pantoken/svelte`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/svelte) (gweithred eicon + darllen "
"tokenau).\n"
"\n"
"## Datblygu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Beth sydd yma\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` yn galw `register()` (o `@pantoken/svelte`) unwaith wrth "
"bootstrap er mwyn i elfennau fel\n"
"  `<instui-icon>` weithio mewn templedi, ac yn mewnforio'r CSS token ynghyd "
"â `@pantoken/interactions`\n"
"  (yn cysylltu modal, awgrymwr offer, a ymddygiadau cydrannau eraill yn "
"ddiofyn).\n"
"- Mae marc-up `src/App.svelte` wedi'i steilio gyda dosbarthiadau `instui-*`; "
"pwyntiau mewnosod dewisol (penawd,\n"
"  hidlwyr, cynnwys, olaf) wedi'u nodi gyda `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Gosodwch ddosbarthiadau fel `class=\"instui-button\"` ar farc-up; gweler "
"y\n"
"  [cyfeirlyfr cydran](https://pantoken.app/api/css) am y rhestr lawn o "
"ddosbarthiadau.\n"
"\n"
"## Dysgu mwy\n"
"\n"
"Gweler y [canllaw dechrau](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) i "
"ddysgu mwy.\n"

#: vue/README.md
