#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Ap TypeScript syml (trwy Vite) wedi'i arddullio gyda\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"ac yn defnyddio\n"
"elfennau arferol annibynnol ar fframwaith o\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Datblygu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Beth sydd yma\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` yn mewnforio `@pantoken/css` (yn diffinio pob `--instui-*` "
"eiddo arferol),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (dosbarthiadau `.instui-"
"*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (yn cysylltu modal, awgrymwyr offer, a "
"gweithredoedd cydrannau eraill allan o'r\n"
"  bocs), a `@pantoken/web-components` (yn cofrestru elfennau'n awtomatig fel "
"`<instui-icon>`), ac yna\n"
"  yn rendro marcŵp i `#app`.\n"
"- Mae pwyntiau mewnosod dewisol (penawd, hidlwyr, cynnwys, diwedd) wedi'u "
"marcio gyda\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — disodli eu cynnwys gyda'ch marcŵp eich hun.\n"
"- Defnyddiwch elfennau arferol yn uniongyrchol yn y marcŵp, e.e. `<instui-"
"button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  gweler y [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  am y rhestr lawn o elfennau.\n"
"\n"
"## Dysgu mwy\n"
"\n"
"Gweler y [canllaw HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) i ddysgu "
"mwy.\n"
